{"created": "2022-09-06T14:43:23.193476+00:00", "modified": "2022-10-26T21:48:07.039566+00:00", "id": 7007362, "conceptrecid": "7007361", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7007362", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.7007361", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7007362", "metadata": {"title": "HippUnfold HCP-YA Training Data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.7007362", "publication_date": "2022-08-18", "description": "<p>Hippocampal Tissue segmentations, T1w, T2w, and mean DWI b1000 images in upsampled 0.3mm left and right bounding boxes around the hippocampus. Subjects are from the HCP-1200 Young Adult dataset. These data were used to train the current HippUnfold U-net segmentation models.</p>\n\n<p>Unzip all the zip files, folders will be created for the labelmaps, T1w, T2w, and b1000 images for each hemisphere and subject. Left hipp labels are already L-R flipped to the right side.</p>\n\n<p>Labelmap lookup table:</p>\n\n<pre>index\tname\tabbreviation\n1\thippocampal grey matter\tGM\n2\tSRLM or &#39;dark band&#39;\tSRLM\n3\tneocortex (entorhinal or parahippocampal)\tMTLC\n4\tpial surface\tPial\n5\thippocampal-amygdalar transition area\tHATA\n6\tindusium griseum\tIndGris\n7\tcysts\tCyst\n8\tdentate gyrus\tDG</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Dekraker, Jordan", "affiliation": "University of Western Ontario", "orcid": "0000-0002-4093-0582"}, {"name": "Khan, Ali", "affiliation": "University of Western Ontario", "orcid": "0000-0002-0760-8647"}], "keywords": ["Hippocampus,", "HippUnfold", "Training", "Segmentation"], "version": "v1.0.0", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "journal": {"title": "bioRxiv", "volume": "2021.12.03.471134"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "7007361"}}]}}, "title": "HippUnfold HCP-YA Training Data", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7007362", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7007362?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7007362", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7007362", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7007362", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007361", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7007361", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.7007361", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.7007361", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:7007362/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:7007362/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/7007362/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/7007362/requests"}, "updated": "2022-10-26T21:48:07.039566+00:00", "recid": "7007362", "revision": 3, "files": [{"id": "8fecfccb-7ecd